span></li><li><span class="rf-year">243 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aratus-of-sicyon">Aratus of Sicyon</a> seizes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/acrocorinth">Acrocorinth</a> from its Macedonian garrison</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">222 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/antigonus-iii-doson">Antigonus III Doson</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cleomenes-iii">Cleomenes III</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sparta">Sparta</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-sellasia">Sellasia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">215 BCE</span><span class="rf-text">Philip V allies with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hannibal">Hannibal</a> against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">197 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> defeats Philip V at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-cynoscephalae">Cynoscephalae</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">168 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/perseus-of-macedon">Perseus</a> is defeated at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-pydna">Pydna</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> abolishes the monarchy</span></li></ol>
